OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to women killed in
OL,4,Adog-rescue crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to two British
OL,7,Fwomen who were killed in a crash in
OL,8,FRomania while on a dog rescue trip.
OL,10,FRachael Harvey-Purkiss, from Essex, and
OL,11,FAllison Condon, from Northamptonshire,
OL,12,Fwere in a collision which, according to
OL,13,Freports, involved multiple vehicles on
OL,14,FThursday.
OL,16,FSerena Nuth, Condon's sister, said both
OL,17,Fwomen were volunteers who "did this
OL,18,Fwork purely for love".
OL,20,FShe said: "Allison was absolutely
OL,21,Fdogb@Qmad; helping animals brought her
OL,22,Fso much joy and purpose."
